can be bounded, up to a constant, by a deterministic function, namely
\begin{equation}
\label{key-D}
\|D_{r,y,z}u(t,x)\|_p \leq C'_{T,p,\nu,\k}|z| \int_{\bR}G_{t-r}(x-y')\k(y-y')dy',
\end{equation}

