To prove the main theorem, the authors “develop a variational framework tailored to the nodal setting of
\begin{equation}\label{eq1.1}
	\begin{cases}
		-\Delta u_i + u_i
		= \mu_i Q_\varepsilon(x-y_i) |u_i|^{2p-2}u_i
		+ \sum_{j\neq i} \lambda_{ij} |u_j|^{p} |u_i|^{p-2}u_i, \\[6pt]
