$$
H_n^{(m)}:=\sum_{k=1}^n\frac{1}{k^m}.
$$

Our main purpose is to establish a $p$-adic analogue of Whipple's formula \eqref{Whipple} with $a=b=c=\alpha$ and $d=\f12$.

